{"sourceUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/71/3c/c12276a225596/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.631693+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/71/3c/c12276a225596/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>        为让更多同学了解中国药科大学</span><span><span>工</span></span><span>学院的科研方向、科研条件、文化氛围及研究生培养特色，吸引更多优秀学生加入中国药科大学</span><span><span>工</span></span><span>学院，学院将组织开展</span></span></span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名工作（以下简称推免生预报名工作）。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/71/3c/c12276a225596/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>一、招生专业</span></p><p><span>我院</span><span>2026</span><span>年硕士招生专业目录中所有全日制专业均可接收硕士推免生。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>研究方向代码</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>研究方向名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007Z1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>制药工程学</span></span></span></p></td><td><br/></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>077700</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span></span></p></td><td><br/></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>制药工程与工艺</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>03</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物材料与诊断试剂</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>04</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>食品科学与营养工程</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>05</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>绿色制药与健康</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>095500</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>食品与营养</span></span></span></p></td><td><br/></td><td><br/></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>直博生招收专业：</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007Z1</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>制药工程学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>077700</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>二、报名条件</span></p><p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>全国高校</span><span>2026</span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校免试推荐资格。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></p><p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></p><p><span>5</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>申报直博生的考生，截至目前总评成绩应在本科推免环节排名前</span><span>8%</span><span>（含</span><span>8%</span><span>）；各类国家级基地班的学生截至目前总评成绩应在本科推免环节排名前</span><span>50%</span><span>（含</span><span>50%</span><span>），入选“药学拔尖创新人才培养计划”的学生不做排名要求。</span></p><p><span>6</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>具有良好的英语水平，</span><span>CET-6</span><span>成绩合格或达到六级相应水平。</span></p><p><span>其中申报直博生的考生，要求六级（</span><span>CET-6</span><span>）成绩≥</span><span>450</span><span>分；或托福（</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>）成绩≥</span><span>90</span><span>分；或雅思（</span><span>IELTS</span><span>）成绩≥</span><span>7</span><span>；或以第一作者（排位第一）在</span><span>SCI</span><span>期刊（不含扩展版）上发表过一篇专业学术研究论文（成绩有效期均在</span><span>4</span><span>年之内）。 </span></p><p><span>7</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>中国药科大学“本</span><span>-</span><span>博贯通班”在读学生的本科推免环节排名及英语水平要求按照学校面向该专业制定的相关文件执行。</span></p><p><span>8</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>申请人可以综合考虑各学院推免生预报名工作安排，合理自愿填报多个学院，但同一个学院内限填报</span><span>1</span><span>个硕士志愿。直博生申请人仅限填报</span><span>1</span><span>个直博生志愿，并可同时填报硕士志愿。申请人若跨</span><span>2</span><span>个及以上学院填报志愿，需要再次注册账号。</span></p><p><span>三、报名材料</span></p><p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>身份证或在读学生证（必填）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></p><p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>外语水平证明，如</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></p><p><span>5</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></p><p><span>6</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></p><p><span>7</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>专家推荐书（暂不必填）：申请直博生者提供至少</span><span>2</span><span>份《专家推荐书》（可在预报名系统中生成下载模板），由所报考学科专业领域内的正高级教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）撰写的书面推荐意见（推免硕士生是否提交《专家推荐书》不做硬性要求）。</span></p><p><span>报考硕士研究生的材料由学院进行资格审查，直博生的报考材料由研究生院统一进行资格审查。</span></p><p><span>四、报名时间及方式</span></p><p><span>系统报名阶段开放时间：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span>-8</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>报名方式：登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span><span>）</span><span>,</span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。系统账户考生需自行注册使用，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></p><p><span>学院对申请人资格进行审核，确定入选名单，并于</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日前通知申请人，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。入选同学须于</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日下午</span><span>17:00</span><span>前在报名系统中回复确认是否参加，逾期未回复者视为自动放弃。</span></p><p><span>五、考核安排</span></p><p><span>1</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span>本次活动采用线下形式进行</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>.</span></span><span>活动安排：</span><span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>活动地点</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span>日上午10:00</span></p></td><td><p><span>学院宣讲、学科宣讲、参观实验室等</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>实训楼</span><span>401报告厅</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span>日下午13:00</span></p></td><td><p><span>各学科专家组面试考核</span></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>详见附件</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>《工学院2026年接收推免生预报名面试考核安排》</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日</span></p></td><td><p><span>自由参观交流</span></p></td><td><p>  </p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>六、食宿交通及相关保障</span><br/></p><p><span>考生来校参加考核期间的交通、食宿费用自理。学校统一为参加考核考生购买在校活动期间的意外保险。</span></p><p><span>七、联系方式</span></p><p><span>电话：</span><span>025-8618</span><span><span>5754</span></span><span>；邮箱：</span><span><span>gxycpu@126.com.</span></span></p><p><span>重点提醒：申请我校推荐免试研究生的</span><span>2026</span><span>年应届本科毕业生，在全国推免服务系统（预计</span><span>9</span><span>月中下旬）开放后，仍须在该系统中注册并填报志愿，并根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。届时请关注我校研究生招生网和中国研究生招生信息网的通知。</span></p><p><span>欢迎各位同学踊跃报名！</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>中国药科大学工学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>附件：工学院2026年接收推免生预报名面试考核安排</span></span></p><p><br/></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>面试地点</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>面试时间</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>学硕</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>制药工程学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B301</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>13</span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>生物医学工程</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B302</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span><span><span>专硕</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药（制药工程与工艺）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B301</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（生物材料与诊断</span></span></span><span><span><span>试剂</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B302</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药（食品科学与营养工程）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B303</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span></span><span><span><span>绿色制药与健康</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B301</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>食品与营养</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>江宁校区教学楼</span></span><span><span>B303</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><a href=\"https://gxy.cpu.edu.cn/71/3c/c12276a225596/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><br/></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><span><span><br/></span></span><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e3f0f184399f94ba90daea5b4388172dacb386906ff99ebd59bc5b364802ee54","textLength":2266,"sourceSha256":"e15444718e03f65640e3ca80b8f29f631683446f524d1a9662174ce70b96db52","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ca8bb9c80f4ecf1dc353","title":"2025年中国药科大学工学院2026年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.631693+00:00"}
